From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:50:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] Make actual page layout admission and import fallback
 transactional

Validate actual texture and implicit GBM export tuples against the complete negotiated set before creation IPC. Keep legal unsized U8 allocation separate from sized Skia descriptors. Preserve a valid committed texture on late import failure and retire rejected allocation ownership explicitly.

A bounded per-surface rejection transaction requests one ordinary SHM repaint through dedicated compositor callbacks. SHM rejection is terminal without a retry chain. Cleanup uses the registered owning GL context and queue. Compilation and tests remain pending coordinated admission.
